{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.028, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 21, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:30.000Z", "t_ms": 4970, "delta": "Tool"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.102, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 22, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:30.075Z", "t_ms": 5045, "delta": "former decides whether an inserted API call is worth keeping based on whether providing both the API call"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.273, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 23, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:30.247Z", "t_ms": 5217, "delta": " and its result reduces the model's loss when predicting future tokens [C2, C4].\n\nSpecifically, for"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.453, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 24, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:30.426Z", "t_ms": 5396, "delta": " a sequence of tokens $x_{1}, \\ldots, x_{n}$ and an API call $c_{i}$ inserted"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.606, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:30.579Z", "t_ms": 5549, "delta": " at position $i$ with response $r_{i}$, Toolformer evaluates the weighted cross-entropy loss over the subsequent"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.764, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:30.739Z", "t_ms": 5709, "delta": " tokens $x_{i}, \\ldots, x_{n}$ under different conditions [C4]:\n\n* $L_{i}^{+}"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 5.9, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:30.873Z", "t_ms": 5843, "delta": " = L_{i}(\\text{e}(c_{i}, r_{i}))$: The loss when prefixing the subsequent"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.105, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:30.977Z", "t_ms": 5947, "delta": " tokens with the API call and its result [C4].\n* $L_{i}^{-} = \\min\\left"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.118, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:31.093Z", "t_ms": 6063, "delta": "(L_{i}(\\varepsilon), L_{i}(\\text{e}(c_{i}, \\varepsilon))\\right)$:"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.282, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:31.256Z", "t_ms": 6226, "delta": " The baseline loss, defined as the minimum of the losses obtained from (1) doing no API call at all ($\\varepsilon$), and"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.438, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:31.411Z", "t_ms": 6381, "delta": " (2) making the API call but providing no response ($\\text{e}(c_{i}, \\varepsilon)$) [C4"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.633, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:31.607Z", "t_ms": 6577, "delta": "].\n\nGiven a filtering threshold $\\tau_{f}$, Toolformer keeps the API call if and only if:\n\n$$L_{i}^{-} -"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.81, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:31.785Z", "t_ms": 6755, "delta": " L_{i}^{+} \\geq \\tau_{f}$$\n\nThat is, the call is retained only if including the API call and its resulting"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 6.941, "data": {"request_id": "97339889dbd5", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T05:04:31.915Z", "t_ms": 6885, "delta": " response reduces the loss by at least $\\tau_{f}$ compared to having no call or receiving no result [C4, C5"}}
